A restricted-party screening HIT has placed a compliance HOLD. The affected user is blocked
(fail-closed) until a compliance officer adjudicates this in the Descartes Incident Manager.

  Hold ID:            <%= @hold_id %>
  Subject:            <%= @subject_ref %>
  Alert level:        <%= @alert_level || "n/a" %>
  Screening result:   <%= @screening_result_id || "n/a" %>
<% if @trace_id.present? -%>
  Trace ID:           <%= @trace_id %>
<% end -%>

Next step: review and adjudicate this hold in the Descartes Visual Compliance Incident Manager.
Once resolved there, the platform's resolution poller reconciles the verdict and releases the hold
automatically.

Note: this message intentionally contains identifiers only. The screened party's name and details
are available in the Incident Manager, never in this email.
